1. Strengthen the Integrity Commissioner’s independence by amending the
Code to maximize structural autonomy;

2. Work with the Province to amend the Vancouver Charter to (a) explicitly
authorize a municipal Code of Conduct and (b) enable an independent
Integrity Commissioner;

